                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The lowest class of society; also, the lower classes of society generally; the masses."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "also",
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "often"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4942ce4a-1de1-36a1-95fb-f7f1a9436c48",
                                        "entry_id": "eb6dc2f8-7ed2-32f0-ad4f-5d4210bea8f5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Wage earners collectively; people who own no capital and depend on their labour for survival; the working class, especially when seen as engaged in a class struggle with the bourgeoisie (“the capital-owning class”)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Marxism"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d11ebe3-57e1-4bd0-bcd5-faf98d02bd24",
                                                "sense_id": "4942ce4a-1de1-36a1-95fb-f7f1a9436c48",
                                                "text": "Of all the classes that stand face to face with the bourgeoisie to-day, the proletariat alone is a really revolutionary class. The other classes decay and finally disappear in the face of modern industry; the proletariat is its special and essential product."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f7e67373-207f-3e68-86a7-2b42281b6f36",
                                        "entry_id": "eb6dc2f8-7ed2-32f0-ad4f-5d4210bea8f5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The lowest class of citizens, who had no property and few rights, and were regarded as contributing only their offspring to the state."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ancient-Rome",
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
